      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# CAUCE 70 · coordinate-map composition\n\nThe same affine and nonlinear pullbacks are evaluated in two ways. The upper\npath composes both maps and samples the plate once. The lower path performs two\nsequential image warps, deliberately reproducing a feedback-like second pass.\nBoth results contain 124 frames and use no H3 sample."
      ],
      "color": "#24382a",
      "bgcolor": "#132019"
    },
